config BR2_PACKAGE_RPI_EEPROM
	bool "rpi-eeprom"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3
	depends on BR2_aarch64
	help
	  Raspberry Pi EEPROM bootloader configuration and update tools.

	  Installs rpi-eeprom-config, rpi-eeprom-update, rpi-eeprom-digest,
	  and the Pi 5 (BCM2712) firmware blobs needed for EEPROM updates.

	  rpi-eeprom-config reads the current bootloader configuration via
	  the kernel nvmem device (no vcgencmd required on Pi 5).

	  https://github.com/raspberrypi/rpi-eeprom
